      Text: A dark abandoned facility where broken lights, empty rooms, and strange
        silence create an unsettling atmosphere.
    - Key: description.corridors
      Text: Long, narrow corridors stretch ahead, making every step feel tense as
        the player moves deeper into the unknown.
    - Key: description.ending
      Text: The final confrontation begins here. The player has reached the end,
        where the mystery is finally revealed.
